📌Definition:-Abstraction is hiding internal implementation & just highlighting the setup services that we are offering.

Real life example of 🚗 Car:- (iska matlab: car ke andar ke internal components jaise engine ka working, gearbox ka mechanism, clutch ka mechanism, brakes ka internal system, fuel combustion process — yeh sab user se chhupa hota hai, kyunki in cheezon ko jaankar user kuchh directly use nahi kar sakta. User ko sirf wahi cheezein provide ki jaati hain jo actually uske kaam ki hoti hain like Steering ghumao → car turn kare
Accelerator dabao → speed badhe
Brake dabao → car ruk jaaye
Gear change karo → smooth drive.)


-in "abstract class" , (0 ya 100)% abstraction achieve Kiya ja sakta hai .

- in  "interfaces",  purely 100% abstraction achieve Kiya jata hai not 20%,30% but directly 100% achieve karte Hain.
